{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163","id":539272874,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1MzkyNzI4NzQ=","number":3163,"title":"[YSQL] \"ALTER TABLE t DROP CONSTRAINT t_pk\" succeeds but should fail","user":{"login":"bllewell","id":49999172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk5MTcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49999172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell","html_url":"https://github.com/bllewell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bllewell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"},{"id":1280238232,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjgwMjM4MjMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/ysql","name":"area/ysql","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-12-17T19:44:27Z","updated_at":"2020-05-28T12:59:58Z","closed_at":"2020-05-28T12:58:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"YB, through Version 2.0.6, treats a table's PK constraint as immutable. If a table is created with no PK, then you cannot add one because it uses an internal row identifier that's inaccessible to the user. Specifically, following this:\r\n```\r\ncreate table t(k1 int, v varchar);\r\n```\r\nthese fail:\r\n```\r\nalter table t add constraint t_pk primary key(k1);\r\n```\r\nand\r\n```\r\nalter table t add column k2 int constraint t_pk primary key;\r\n\r\n```\r\nAnd If a table is created with a PK, then you cannot (or, more carefully, _are supposed not to be able to_) change anything about its specification or any value in any column that the constraint spans. See Issue #1822. Specifically, following this:\r\n```\r\ncreate table t(\r\n  k1 int,\r\n  k2 varchar(10),\r\n  v varchar,\r\n  constraint t_pk primary key(k1, k2));\r\ninsert into t(k1, k2, v) values(1, 'x', 'dog');\r\n```\r\nthese fail:\r\n```\r\nalter table t drop column k1;\r\n```\r\nand\r\n```\r\nupdate t set k1 = 2 where k1 = 1 and k2 = 'x';\r\n```\r\nThis also fails:\r\n```\r\nalter table t alter column k1 type varchar(20);\r\n```\r\nbut the failure message is the same when this change is attempted on a column that's not spanned by the PK.\r\n\r\nHowever, this quietly succeeds:\r\n```\r\nalter table t drop constraint t_pk\r\n```\r\n**This is a bug.**\r\n\r\nNow, following this starting state:\r\n```\r\n k1 | k2 |  v  \r\n----+----+-----\r\n  1 | x  | dog\r\n```\r\nthis `insert` attempt:\r\n```\r\ninsert into t(k1, k2, v) values(1, 'x', 'cat');\r\n```\r\ncauses this error:\r\n```\r\nERROR:  duplicate key value violates unique constraint \"t\"\r\n```\r\nYet `\\d t` shows that table `t` has no constraints. In other words, you're left in an undefined—and incomprehensible—state.","closed_by":{"login":"frozenspider","id":2077017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzcwMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2077017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider","html_url":"https://github.com/frozenspider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frozenspider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3163/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}